  "question": {
    "text": "<p>With respect to the following reaction, consider the given statements:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b270c54f-0b75-4d88-8d16-b0c425534727-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 79px;\" /></p><p>(A) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></math>-Nitroaniline and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math>-nitroaniline are the predominant products.</p><p>(B) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math>-Nitroaniline and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>-nitroaniline are the predominant products.</p><p>(C) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> acts as an acid.</p><p>(D) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> acts as an acid.</p><p>Choose the correct option.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
